<section class="tree-demo" aria-labelledby="tree-title"><h2 id="tree-title">从比对位点比较候选树</h2><p>原理示意：四条虚构序列已对齐，依次比较三种无根树。示例使用最大简约法统计最少状态变化次数，不执行 IQ-TREE 的最大似然分析。</p><div class="tree-table"><table><caption>虚构比对数据</caption><thead><tr><th>序列</th><th>位点 1</th><th>位点 2</th><th>位点 3</th><th>位点 4</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>甲</th><td>A</td><td>A</td><td>A</td><td>A</td></tr><tr><th>乙</th><td>A</td><td>A</td><td>A</td><td>T</td></tr><tr><th>丙</th><td>T</td><td>T</td><td>T</td><td>A</td></tr><tr><th>丁</th><td>T</td><td>T</td><td>T</td><td>T</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p id="tree-explanation" aria-live="polite"></p><div><button type="button" id="tree-prev">上一步</button> <button type="button" id="tree-next">下一步</button> <button type="button" id="tree-reset">重置</button></div><p>得分是四个位点的最少变化次数之和：甲乙｜丙丁为 5，甲丙｜乙丁为 7，甲丁｜乙丙为 8。最少变化只说明这个模型下的结果，真实推断需要更多位点、适合的模型与支持度评估。</p></section>
<script>
let treeStep=0;const treeText=['第 1 步：比较四个位点，前三个位点的状态分别按甲乙与丙丁分组。','第 2 步：位点 4 的状态按甲丙与乙丁分组，与前三个位点的信号不同。','第 3 步：对每棵候选树求四个位点最少变化次数：甲乙｜丙丁 5，甲丙｜乙丁 7，甲丁｜乙丙 8；该简化例子选择得分最小的树。'];
const showTree=()=>{const label=document.querySelector('#tree-explanation');if(label)label.textContent=treeText[treeStep];const prev=document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('#tree-prev'),next=document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('#tree-next');if(prev)prev.disabled=treeStep===0;if(next)next.disabled=treeStep===2;};document.querySelector('#tree-prev')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{treeStep=Math.max(0,treeStep-1);showTree()});document.querySelector('#tree-next')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{treeStep=Math.min(2,treeStep+1);showTree()});document.querySelector('#tree-reset')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{treeStep=0;showTree()});showTree();
</script>
<style>.tree-demo{padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--border);background:#f8fbfa;border-radius:12px;margin:32px 0}.tree-table{overflow-x:auto}.tree-demo table{border-collapse:collapse;min-width:450px;width:100%}.tree-demo th,.tree-demo td{padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);text-align:center}.tree-demo p{font-size:.9rem}.tree-demo button{margin:4px}</style>
